 predicted fetch target while preserving imemReady, reset, redirect priority, and sequential fallback.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Pipeline the immutable return prediction token with its instruction and clear it on bubbles or flushes.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Validate a return prediction against the resolved JALR target and instruction PC, suppressing redirects only for exact aligned matches and repairing all misses.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Connect prediction lookup, EX validation, and retirement push/pop training without changing the single-channel RVFI contract or order.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: pc_fwd_ch0\\ne=0)\\nSBY 20:27:53 [insn_xori_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 20:27:53 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:01 (1)\\nSBY 20:27:53 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:01 (1)\\nSBY 20:27:53 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 20:27:53 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 20:27:53 [insn_xori_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:46  Status: passed\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=0)\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:46 (46)\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:42 (42)\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 20:28:27 [reg_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\n\\nFormal: 52 passed, 1 failed\\nFailed: pc_fwd_ch0\\n\\n--- pc_fwd_ch0/logfile.txt (last 30 lines) ---\\nSBY 20:27:41 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 8..\\nSBY 20:27:41 [pc_fwd_ch0