 branch targets, and a\\ntwo-bit taken counter. A tagged hit in IF predicts the cached target using\\nonly the current PC, keeping opcode/funct/immediate decode out of the IF\\ncritical path. Carry the predicted next PC with the instruction; in EX,\\ncompare it with the resolved branch next PC and redirect only on a\\nmisprediction. Train the BTB from resolved conditional branches, saturating\\ntoward taken or not-taken, while retaining precise flush, trap, RVFI, and\\nload/store stall behavior. This should remove repeated taken-loop redirect\\nbubbles without repeating the timing-costly fetch-time BTFNT logic.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add predicted-next-PC and prediction-valid metadata to the IF/ID and ID/EX pipeline bundles.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement a small tagged BTB with two-bit direction counters, PC-only lookup, redirect recovery, and resolved-branch training.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Pipeline the BTB prediction metadata alongside the instruction and decoded operands.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Resolve the actual branch next PC and assert redirect only when it differs from the carried prediction, preserving misalignment traps.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire resolved conditional-branch PC, target, and outcome back to IF for BTB training while preserving existing hazard and RVFI control.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add predicted-next-PC and prediction-valid metadata to the IF/ID and ID/EX pipeline bundles.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement a small tagged BTB with two-bit direction counters, PC-only lookup, redirect recovery, and resolved-branch training.\"}, {\"file\": \"r