9s2\", \"title\": \"Epoch-qualified one-entry loop predictor\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"CoreMark repeatedly executes backward conditional loops, but prior BTBs and\\nstatic predictors paid too much IF timing and pipeline metadata overhead.\\nThe one-entry exact-PC target experiment was close to neutral, making a\\nsmaller loop-only predictor with stronger prediction/repair atomicity the\\nmost promising remaining predictor direction.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark repeatedly executes backward conditional loops, but prior BTBs and\\nstatic predictors paid too much IF timing and pipeline metadata overhead.\\nThe one-entry exact-PC target experiment was close to neutral, making a\\nsmaller loop-only predictor with stronger prediction/repair atomicity the\\nmost promising remaining predictor direction.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a one-entry exact-PC loop-target predictor that is trained only by a\\nretiring, taken backward conditional branch and is enabled only after the\\ntarget has been observed. IF performs just a tag compare and target mux,\\nwith no opcode or immediate decode; the instruction carries a compact\\nprediction token plus predictor epoch, while EX revalidates the same entry\\nand suppresses its redirect only for an epoch-matched taken target. A\\npredicted loop exit redirects to the fall-through path and invalidates the\\nentry at retirement. Epoch-qualified lookup and retirement-only training\\nkeep replacement, stalls, flushes, RVFI pc_wdata, and wrong-path state from\\ncreating the pc_fwd failure seen in the earlier loop-target cache.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 2, \"confidence\": \"low\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add compact loop-prediction valid/epoch fields to the IF/ID and ID/EX records without carrying a predicted 32-bit target through the pipeline.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement the one-entry exact-PC backward-loop target state, IF tag/target lookup, epoch tracking, EX revalidation, and retirement-only taken/exit training.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use an epoch-qualified predictor hit to select the next fetch PC while preserving imemReady, redirect, reset, and flush priority and emitting an atomic prediction token.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Pipeline the prediction token and captured epoch with its owning instruction, clearing them on bubbles and redirects.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare the prediction token and epoch-qualified predictor hit with the resolved branch next PC, suppressing only an agreeing taken-loop redirect and repairing all mismatches precisely.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Connect predictor lookup, EX validation, and MEM/WB retirement training without changing the single-channel RVFI contract or retirement ordering.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 2, \"confidence\": \"low\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add compact loop-prediction valid/epoch fields to the IF/ID and ID/EX records without carrying a predicted 32-bit target through the pipeline.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement the one-entry exact-PC backward-loop target state, IF tag/target lookup, epoch tracking, EX revalidation, and retirement-only taken/exit training.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use an epoch-qualified predictor hit to select the next fetch PC while preserving imemReady, redirect, reset, and flush priority and emitting an atomic prediction token.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Pipeline the prediction token and captured epoch with its owning instruction, clearing them on bubbles and redirects.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare the prediction token and epoch-qualified predictor hit with the resolved branch next PC, suppressing only an agreeing taken-loop redirect and repairing all mismatches precisely.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Connect predictor lookup, EX validation, and MEM/WB retirement training without changing the single-channel RVFI contract or retirement ordering.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: pc_fwd_ch0\\nde=0)\\nSBY 19:50:33 [insn_xori_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 19:50:33 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:01 (1)\\nSBY 19:50:33 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:01 (1)\\nSBY 19:50:33 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 19:50:33 [insn_xori_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 19:50:33 [insn_xori_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:49  Status: passed\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=0)\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:49 (49)\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:43 (43)\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 19:51:10 [reg_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\n\\nFormal: 52 passed, 1 failed\\nFailed: pc_fwd_ch0\\n\\n--- pc_fwd_ch0/logfile.txt (last 30 lines) ---\\nSBY 19:50:20 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 8..\\nSBY 19:50:20 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 9..\\nSBY 19:50:21 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 10..\\nSBY 19:50:21 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 11..\\nSBY 19:50:21 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 12..\\nSBY 19:50:21 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 13..\\nSBY 19:50:21 [pc_fwd_ch0]