  1 bonetto  staff     317 Jul 10 19:40 .agent.hyp-20260710-002-r9s1.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff   73106 Jul 10 19:40 .agent.hyp-20260710-002-r9s1.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     339 Jul 10 19:56 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r10s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff  172389 Jul 10 19:56 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r10s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff  152843 Jul 10 20:17 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r11s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     287 Jul 10 16:53 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r1s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff   43921 Jul 10 16:53 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r1s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     297 Jul 10 17:14 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r2s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff   14453 Jul 10 17:14 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r2s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     204 Jul 10 17:39 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r3s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff   48089 Jul 10 17:39 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r3s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     315 Jul 10 18:00 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r4s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff   74123 Jul 10 18:00 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r4s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     316 Jul 10 18:23 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r5s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff   89485 Jul 10 18:23 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r5s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     323 Jul 10 18:47 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r6s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff   92877 Jul 10 18:47 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r6s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     296 Jul 10 19:04 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r7s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff  121137 Jul 10 19:04 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r7s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     320 Jul 10 19:21 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r8s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff  133562 Jul 10 19:21 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r8s2.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff     282 Jul 10 19:40 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r9s2.last\\n-rw-r--r--   1 bonetto  staff  154632 Jul 10 19:40 .agent.hyp-20260710-003-r9s2.log\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_4\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"The prior structural attempts show three traps: front-end buffering was hurt by redirect/refill bubbles, a memory queue failed liveness/order, and sideband splitting unexpectedly worsened routing. I’m narrowing the proposal to a same-depth structural change that removes common-path fanout without adding speculative state or a new retirement protocol.\"}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
