ry nonblocking store buffer\", \"category\": \"structural\", \"motivation\": \"The current five-stage pipeline freezes globally whenever an EX/MEM store\\nsees io_dmemReady low, even though a store has no result that younger ALU\\ninstructions need. The prior general completion-queue attempt failed\\nliveness, so a bounded store-only structure is a lower-risk way to overlap\\nthe benchmark's random data-bus stalls without introducing broad out-of-order\\nretirement machinery.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The current five-stage pipeline freezes globally whenever an EX/MEM store\\nsees io_dmemReady low, even though a store has no result that younger ALU\\ninstructions need. The prior general completion-queue attempt failed\\nliveness, so a bounded store-only structure is a lower-risk way to overlap\\nthe benchmark's random data-bus stalls without introducing broad out-of-order\\nretirement machinery.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a one-entry FIFO store buffer at the MEM boundary. A store is accepted\\ninto the buffer and retires in program order, while the buffer independently\\nholds its address, byte mask, and replicated write data until io_dmemReady\\nacknowledges the write. Allow younger non-memory instructions to proceed\\nbehind a buffered store; keep younger loads ordered by stalling them on a\\npossible store-buffer address conflict, and stop the front end only when the\\nbuffer is full or an older memory-order condition requires it. Keep loads,\\nRVFI fields, redirects, and trap handling on the existing precise path so\\nthis structural change primarily removes store-induced global bubbles.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a compact store-buffer entry type carrying valid, address, mask, write data, and RVFI ordering metadata without changing the top-level contract.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Split store acceptance from external write completion, drive the single buffered request until dmemReady, and expose precise store retirement data while preserving aligned-memory semantics.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Integrate the store-buffer ready/full and address-conflict signals so younger independent ALU instructions can flow while a stalled store drains, with in-order retirement and redirect interaction preserved.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace unconditional store-induced pipeline freezing with bounded store-buffer backpressure and conservative load/store ordering checks.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a compact store-buffer entry type carrying valid, address, mask, write data, and RVFI ordering metadata without changing the top-level contract.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Split store acceptance from external write completion, drive the single buffered request until dmemReady, and expose precise store retirement data while preserving aligned-memory semantics.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Integrate the store-buffer ready/full and address-conflict signals so younger independent ALU instructions can flow while a stalled store drains, with in-order retirement and redirect interaction preserved.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace unconditional store-induced pipeline freezing with bounded store-buffer backpressure and conservative load/store ordering checks.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 374.56, \"delta_pct\": -7.94, \"vs_baseline\": 32.44, \"fmax_mhz\": 166.97, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4457730, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 7622, \"ff\": 1870, \"seeds\": [172.47, 166.97, 160.49], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"