ypass network.  Generate EX/MEM and MEM/WB hit terms beside the\\nregister-number comparisons, gate comparisons for operands unused by the\\ndecoded instruction, and select the freshest 32-bit value with shallow\\ncascaded muxes in EX.  Preserve EX/MEM-over-MEM/WB priority, x0 behavior,\\nload-use stalling, branch/store operand values, and all RVFI-visible source\\ndata.  Removing the select encode/decode layer should shorten the common\\ndependency-to-ALU path and reduce control fanout without changing IPC.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 3, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/forward_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace two-bit forwarding selects with source-use-gated EX/MEM and MEM/WB hit/data bypass signals, preserving freshest-writer priority and x0 suppression.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the direct priority bypass values for ALU, branch, and store operands, minimizing the operand mux depth while retaining exact forwarding behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire ID/EX operand values and decoded source-use controls into the direct bypass network without changing the pipeline or RVFI contract.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 3, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/forward_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace two-bit forwarding selects with source-use-gated EX/MEM and MEM/WB hit/data bypass signals, preserving freshest-writer priority and x0 suppression.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the direct priority bypass values for ALU, branch, and store operands, minimizing the operand mux depth while retaining exact forwarding behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire ID/EX operand values and decoded source-use controls into the direct bypass network without changing the pipeline or RVFI contract.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": 