p-20260710-002-r7s1 (regression, -1.64%): Stage-local micro-op typedefs do not guarantee a timing win when EX/MEM still carries broad retirement metadata and the split adds payload repacking and routing, so control partitioning must reduce physical fanout rather than only reorganize fields.\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
