registered iterative divide/remainder execution state, completion result, and precise operand/control capture while preserving forwarding and misalignment/trap metadata.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Generate a divide-unit busy/hold interlock that freezes younger instructions without duplicating or retiring the in-flight divide, while retaining existing load-use, redirect, and dmem-stall precedence.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire divide request, busy, and completion signals through the pipeline so DIV/REM retire once in order through the existing single RVFI channel.\"\nYAML OK\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
