{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The selected angle is a deliberately narrow, certainty-only predictor: fold unconditional `JAL` fetches in IF, with no table, no prediction token, and no EX agreement machinery. Because `JAL` has an architecturally exact immediate target, this targets redirect bubbles while avoiding the broad branch metadata and speculative-state costs that dominated the failed attempts."}}
