on.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement a two-entry fully tagged target buffer with confidence-qualified lookup, taken training, conditional-not-taken decay, and reset-safe replacement.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Select a registered BTB target from the fetch PC without decoding imemData, preserve imemReady and redirect priority, and emit atomic prediction metadata with each fetched instruction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Pipeline prediction metadata unchanged alongside the instruction and decoded control state.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute the resolved next PC, compare it with the carried prediction, generate redirects only on misses, and preserve misalignment-trap and precise pc_next behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire BTB lookup/training and prediction-aware flush control through the existing single-issue pipeline without changing the RVFI contract.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 306.85, \"delta_pct\": -24.58, \"vs_baseline\": 8.5, \"fmax_mhz\": 132.05, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4303443, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 7928, \"ff\": 2031, \"seeds\": [123.93, 132.05, 134.3], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T21:37:48.155196Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 5, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-07-10 hyp-20260710-003-r5s2 (regression, -24.58%): Even confidence-gating a two-entry tagged BTB can regress CoreMark when every fetched instruction carries `predicted_valid`/`predicted_next_pc` through ID/EX and pays IF next-PC selection plus EX resolved-next-PC comparison and flush-repair overhead for a small number of saved loop redirects.\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
