c per-instruction prediction token.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Pipeline the prediction token alongside the instruction and decoded control state.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Recompute the predicted target from the EX lookup, suppress redirects only for tokenized agreeing predictions, and redirect precisely on misses or exits.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the predictor lookup/training and token-aware redirect path through the existing single-issue pipeline without changing the RVFI contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
