, and retirement-only taken/exit training.\"\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Use an epoch-qualified predictor hit to select the next fetch PC while preserving imemReady, redirect, reset, and flush priority and emitting an atomic prediction token.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Pipeline the prediction token and captured epoch with its owning instruction, clearing them on bubbles and redirects.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Compare the prediction token and epoch-qualified predictor hit with the resolved branch next PC, suppressing only an agreeing taken-loop redirect and repairing all mismatches precisely.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Connect predictor lookup, EX validation, and MEM/WB retirement training without changing the single-channel RVFI contract or retirement ordering.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
