\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py:294:    verifier ignore it on trap=1; both are accepted by riscv-formal.\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py:351:            \"mem_stage.sv\", \"wb_stage.sv\",\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py:352:            \"hazard_unit.sv\", \"forward_unit.sv\",\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py:353:            \"core.sv\",\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
