{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The bench is single-issue (`nret: 1`), and its cosim bus treats `io_dmemReady` as acceptance of the currently driven request. I’m using a 16-line/4-word cache with a one-bit refill state machine: hits are locally complete, stores remain synchronous write-through, and refill beats are accepted one at a time while EX/MEM stays frozen."}}
